# Wakeup sources that are plain sysfs or inherit a parent's sysfs_batteryinfo or
# sysfs_vibrator label; system_suspend can't read either, so every stats poll
# floods the audit log. Most paths match stock; the usb, wireless, cp_master and
# bms supplies and the 7-0033 wireless charger don't. genfscon matches prefixes,
# so battery/wakeup also labels battery/wakeup_fg, as stock does.
